<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC confirms profit forecast.</title>
<headline>SBC confirms profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp chief executive Marcel Ospel confirmed an earlier forecast for a 1997 net profit of 1.7 billion Swiss francs.</p>
<p>&quot;I said earlier today that we are on course for our goals. That means that I confirm this profit goal,&quot; Ospel said in response to a question about whether he was maintaining the net profit forecast given by the bank at its autumn news conference.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +431 1 631 7340</p>
